  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt 1/2 the butter over medium heat. Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1 min. Add water (for the rice) and bring to the boil. Stir in rice, cover and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62737e86f91e1d725a0b9deb/step-4b6d3ba2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice red onion. Cut capsicum into small pieces. Grate zucchini. Drain and rinse black beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62737e86f91e1d725a0b9deb/step-4850aa82.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion and capsicum until softened, 4-5 mins. Add zucchini and black beans. Cook until tender, 2-3 mins.\n• Stir in Mexican seasoning, tomato paste and the remaining butter and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62737e86f91e1d725a0b9deb/step-34867f84.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add water (for the sauce) and vegetable stock. Reduce heat to low and simmer until slightly thickened, 3-4 mins. Season to taste.\n• Divide rice between bowls and top with black bean chilli. Tear over coriander.\n• Serve with sour cream.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62737e86f91e1d725a0b9deb/step-fe7ff2a8.jpg"
    }
  ]
